OL,3,AAt least two dead after explosion
OL,4,Adestroys building close to Acropolis in
OL,5,AAthens
OL,6,
OL,7,FAt least two people have died, with a
OL,8,FBritish national among four more
OL,9,Fmissing, after an explosion destroyed a
OL,10,Fbuilding housing a holiday rental
OL,11,Fproperty in the historic centre of
OL,12,FAthens.
OL,14,FThe blast happened in the Plaka area of
OL,15,Fthe Greek capital, a neighbourhood
OL,16,Fclose to tourist sites such as the
OL,17,FAcropolis.
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,314,300,200,140,0,100
